  "title": "Royal Gold Provides Preliminary Financial Information and Details for the Release of Financial Results for the Second Quarter 2026",
  "summary": "Royal Gold, Inc. (NASDAQ: RGLD) (together with its subsidiaries, “Royal Gold,” the “Company,” “we,” “us,” or “our”) announced preliminary financial information and details for the release of results for the quarter ended June 30, 2026 (\"second quarter\"). Preliminary Second Quarter Estimates Royal Gold's stream sales and preliminary royalty sales and depreciation, depletion and amortization (\"DDA\") estimates 1 in the second quarter are as follows: Stream Segment Sales $311.0 M GEOs 2 69,000",
